E1 estimator: per-cell record of what a D0full writer gets (records, cut, tokens, scope-range coverage)

For a D0full cell the estimate adds, per world, a `full_access` block built from the replayed cell's
own item notes: re-derivations of definition items, how many were cut by the cap, the spread of
records, records dropped and approximate record and prompt tokens, and in how many the definition's
scope range was not fully given (the range is read in the report only). The call counts
(`writer_new`) need no change: D0full's extra requests are new writer requests for definition items.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
